<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Harley downgraded on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Harley downgraded on price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mesirow Financial analyst Greg Salchow said he lowered his rating on Harley-Davidson Inc to market outperform from focus buy.</p>
<p>He said he made the move &quot;based solely on valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>Shares in the motorcycle maker were off 1/4 to 47-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
